== Which museums have the most visitors? ==

{{#invoke:NeoWikiDemo|query|SELECT DISTINCT ?Museum ?Annual_visitors WHERE { ?m a neo-schema:Museum ; rdfs:label ?Museum ; neo-prop:Annual_visitors ?Annual_visitors } ORDER BY DESC(?Annual_visitors)|linkColumns=Museum}}

== Browse ==

{{#invoke:NeoWikiDemo|query|SELECT DISTINCT ?Museum ?City ?Founded ?Annual_visitors WHERE { ?m a neo-schema:Museum ; rdfs:label ?Museum ; neo-prop:City ?c . ?c rdfs:label ?City . OPTIONAL { ?m neo-prop:Founded ?Founded } OPTIONAL { ?m neo-prop:Annual_visitors ?Annual_visitors } } ORDER BY ?Museum|linkColumns=Museum, City}}

