== How this is built ==

* Schemas: [[Schema:Museum]], [[Schema:Artist]], [[Schema:Artwork]], [[Schema:Exhibition]], [[Schema:Annual attendance]], [[Schema:City]]
* [[Special:Subject/sEpfwJLnxyQy6vR|The Rijksmuseum on Special:Subject]] shows its attendance figures inside it, and lists the artwork and exhibition held there under Referenced by.
* See the source of one subject: [{{fullurl:Rijksmuseum|action=edit}} Edit Rijksmuseum]
* The featured museums are embedded with the <code><nowiki>{{#view}}</nowiki></code> parser function. The tables come from SPARQL queries via [[Module:NeoWikiDemo]].
